line	<str>Speak to Ramarno at the Sacred Forge and ask him about a shield. or or depending on previous quests (If he is not at the Forge, you need to speak to him at the big door shortly after you enter the ruins).</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a chaos core on a barronite deposit</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the imbued barronite on the Sacred Forge.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Head to the <col=800000>Varrock Palace</col>.</col>
step	24	-	Quick guide step 24
line	<str>Talk to Elias White in the Jolly Boar Inn.</str>
line	
line	<str>Inspect the plant outside the inn.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the trail west, and inspect the rocks.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the southern trail, and inspect the plant.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the eastern trail, and inspect the spiny bush to get a grubby key.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the eastern trail through the gate, and inspect the green bush.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the eastern trail, and inspect the small bush.</str>
line	
line	<str>Follow the northern trail, and run past the end to find a trapdoor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Upon entering the dungeon, finish the dialogue with Elias.</str>
line	
line	<str>Run north a little bit to the end, then look east over the balcony.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cutscene, run west and pick up three bottles.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill three armoured zombies and use a bottle on the red mist they leave behind.</str>
line	
line	<str>After getting three bottles of red mist, open the west door to find Arrav.</str>
line	
line	<str>Once Arrav leaves, head further north through the corridor.</str>
line	
line	<str>Kill three additional armoured zombies and use a bottle on the red mist they leave behind. (Be sure to stop here if you're planning to kill zombies in the quest instance, going further will end the instance and put you with other players)</str>
line	
line	<str>Open the east door. Run further east a little bit to the end, then look south over the balcony.</str>
line	
line	<str>After the cutscene, leave the dungeon.</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Elias at Varrock Palace and report your findings.</str>
line	
line	<str>After finishing speaking to Captain Rovin, head to the Ruins of Camdozaal</str>
line	
line	<str>Speak to Ramarno at the Sacred Forge and ask him about a shield. or or depending on previous quests (If he is not at the Forge, you need to speak to him at the big door shortly after you enter the ruins).</str>
line	
line	<str>Use a chaos core on a barronite deposit</str>
line	
line	<str>Use the imbued barronite on the Sacred Forge.</str>
line	
line	<str>Head to the Varrock Palace.</str>
line	
line	<col=000080>Speak to <col=800000>Captain Rovin</col> two flights up the north-western staircase to receive the Shield of Arrav.</col>
